        Your data\, including location and child profiles\, is stored securely using Firebase and Cloudinary services. We only collect data necessary for the operation of the BusWatch system.<br><br>

        <b>5. System Limitations</b><br>
        While we strive for 100% accuracy\, GPS tracking depends on network availability and satellite signals. BusWatch is not liable for minor delays or temporary signal losses.<br><br>

