le photo?";afternoon_only_desc,166,V40069161d,7900691692,;"Afternoon Only\: Parent drops off at school. Bus brings child home."<b>Afternoon Only\:</b> Parent drops off at school. Bus brings child home.;on_the_bus,166,V4011c4a23,31011c4a50,;"On the Bus";capacity_hint,166,V402afaefb,3102afaf28,;"e.g. 40";faq_a19,166,V400a52ad6,fb00a52bcd,;"If the app crashes\, try clearing the cache in your phone settings or reinstalling the app. Since this is a school project and not yet on the Play Store\, ensure you have the latest version from our Google Drive link.";faq_q17,166,V4009e28a6,43009e28e5,;"Is there a cost to use the app?";enter_password,166,V400e33cf2,3900e33d27,;"Enter Password";bus_arriving_soon,166,V401cf7169,3e01cf71a3,;"Bus Arrival Soon";about,166,V402017d5e,2a02017d84,;"About Us";faq_q18,166,V400a129ab,4a00a129f1,;"Can I use the app on multiple devices?";faq_q15,166,V4009826aa,3f009826e5,;"How do I reset my password?";faq_q16,166,V4009b27a9,3f009b27e4,;"Who manages the bus routes?";faq_q13,166,V400922488,47009224cb,;"Does the app work without internet?";live_tracking,166,V4011a49bf,37011a49f2,;"Live Tracking";faq_q14,166,V40095257f,4e009525c9,;"Why is the bus icon not moving on the map?";invalid_email,166,V402d0b4dc,3f02d0b517,;"Invalid email address";faq_q11,166,V4008c2296,4c008c22de,;"What happens if my child misses the bus?";first_name_required,166,V402d3b5a1,4602d3b5e3,;"First name is required";faq_q12,166,V4008f2394,49008f23d9,;"Can I choose or switch my bus driver?";dietary_restrictions,166,V4015856ad,45015856ee,;"Dietary Restrictions";failed_to_assign_stop,166,V40292a86f,470292a8b2,;"Failed to assign stop";dingdong_dantes,166,V40301c218,3b0301c24f,;"DingDong Dantes";faq_a20,166,V400a82c13,e400a82cf3,;"To delete your account and remove all personal data\, go to Settings -> Security and tap \"Delete Account\". You will need to wait for a 10-second confirmation timer and type DELETE to proceed.";medical_details,166,V4014451e0,3b01445217,;"Medical Details";faq_a21,166,V400ab2d49,c300ab2e08,;"If your child leaves something behind\, please contact the bus driver or the school transport office immediately via the support email or phone number provided.";password,166,V400e13c90,2d00e13cb9,;"Password";please_agree_to_terms,166,V40110479b,7901104810,;"Please agree to the Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy to continue";faq_q19,166,V400a42a8d,4800a42ad1,;"What should I do if the app crashes?";faq_a28,166,V400c03459,ac00c03501,;"You can update these details in the Student profile section. Some changes may require administrative review before appearing in the app.";english,166,V4010a4623,2b010a464a,;"English";faq_a29,166,V400c3354e,ae00c335f8,;"The app is optimized for low power consumption. It only uses GPS and high data frequency while you are actively tracking a bus on the map.";faq_a26,166,V400ba3245,b800ba32f9,;"Yes\, both parents can log in using the same account credentials or separate accounts linked to the same student profile (if enabled by your school).";faq_a27,166,V400bd3352,b300bd3401,;"Bus tracking is only active during scheduled school days. During holidays\, the map will show no active trips\, and notifications will be paused.";faq_a24,166,V400b43051,8800b430d5,;"You can log out by scrolling to the bottom of the Settings screen and tapping the \"LOGOUT\" button.";faq_a25,166,V400b73129,cf00b731f4,;"Enable the \"Bus Near Stop\" notification in Settings. The app will send you an alert when the bus is within a specific radius of your designated pickup or drop-off point.";faq_a22,166,V400ae2e54,a000ae2ef0,;"Go to Settings -> General and tap on \"Preferred Language\". Currently\, we support English\, with more languages coming soon.";faq_a23,166,V400b12f42,cc00b1300a,;"Currently\, the app focuses on real-time tracking. We are working on a \"History\" feature that will allow you to see past boarding and arrival times in a future update.";faq_a2,166,V400721915,f900721a0a,;"Please check that notifications are enabled in your phone settings for the BusWatch app. Also\, ensure that the specific alerts you want are enabled in the \"Notification Preference\" section of the Settings screen.";reset_orientation,166,V401c66f6f,3f01c66faa,;"Reset Orientation";faq_a3,166,V400751a5f,fd00751b58,;"You can request an address change through the Student Details page. Tap \"Request Edit\" on the address field. Note that changes require admin approval and may take up to 30 days to re-enable after a successful update.";load2_description,166,V400d539ad,a500d53a4e,;"Your child’s safety is our top priority. Our app uses secure technology to protect your data and ensure a safe journey.";load3_description,166,V400d83ad3,8600d83b55,;"By allowing access bus tracking app finds your location and provides you with best rides";e_g_inhaler_epipen_none,166,V401635987,50016359d3,;"e.g.\, Inhaler\, EpiPen (None)";faq_a1,166,V4006f17df,e6006f18c1,;"Navigate to the Home screen and tap on your child's profile. If the bus is currently on a trip\, a map will appear showing the bus's live location and its estimated time of arrival at your stop.";drop_off,166,V401c26eb9,2d01c26ee2,;"DROP OFF";my_location,166,V4023d8f7b,33023d8faa,;"My Location";faq_a6,166,V4007e1de8,a3007e1e87,;"For any technical issues or inquiries\, please email us at buswatch2@gmail.com. We aim to respond to all queries within 24 hours.";edit,166,V4002806b7,25002806d8,;"Edit";faq_a7,166,V400811eda,c600811f9c,;"In the side menu or Home screen\, tap \"Add Child\" and fill out the enrollment form. You will need to provide school details and upload a photo for identification.";contact_phone_number,166,V4016f5c5d,45016f5c9e,;"Contact Phone Number";faq_a4,166,V400781ba6,e100781c83,;"The app provides real-time tracking so you can see exactly where the bus is. If there is a major delay\, the driver or admin will send a notification. You can monitor the live ETA on the map.";faq_a5,166,V4007b1cc8,e1007b1da5,;"Yes\, your data is stored securely using Firebase. Only authorized personnel\, such as administrators and the specific driver assigned to your child's route\, can access necessary information.";asthma,166,V401525521,2901525546,;"Asthma";choose_nearest_stop,166,V40289a542,7e0289a5bc,;"Choose the nearest stop for your child. This will finalize their pickup point.";buswatch,166,V400040095,2d000400be,;"BusWatch";load1_description,166,V400d3389f,ab00d33946,;"Know exactly where your child’s bus is at all times. Our real-time GPS tracking provides peace of mind with accurate updates.";phone_required,166,V402d6b66a,4302d6b6a9,;"Phone number is required";accept,166,V40037093f,2900370964,;"Accept";license_number,166,V401ad6a7c,3601ad6aae,;"License No.";morning,166,V401b86cba,2b01b86ce1,;"Morning";faq_a10,166,V4008a21f9,9b008a2290,;"Yes\, you can update your profile information and photo in the \"Parent Details\" section accessible from the side menu.";total_bus_caps,166,V4025f9af1,34025f9b21,;"TOTAL BUS";full_name,166,V401ea7817,2f01ea7842,;"Full Name";driver_details,166,V401ab6a0e,3901ab6a43,;"Driver Details";grade,166,V4012d4d55,27012d4d78,;"Grade";faq_a17,166,V4009f28ea,bf009f29a5,;"The app is provided as a service by your school or transportation provider. Check with them to see if any fees are included in your transportation package.";assign_driver_optional,166,V402b1af61,4b02b1afa8,;"Assign Driver (Optional)";faq_a18,166,V400a229f6,9500a22a87,;"Yes\, you can log in with your account on multiple smartphones. Your settings and child profiles will stay synced.";faq_a15,166,V4009926ea,bd009927a3,;"You can change your password while logged in via Settings -> Security. If you forgot your password\, use the \"Forgot Password\" link on the login screen.";temporary_route_change,166,V401ce70f7,7101ce7164,;"Temporary route change due to road construction on Main Street";faq_a16,166,V4009c27e9,bb009c28a0,;"Routes are managed by the school transportation administrators. They assign drivers and buses to specific routes and stops based on student enrollment.";pending_parents,166,V402639bdd,3b02639c14,;"Pending Parents";faq_a13,166,V4009324d0,ad00932579,;"No\, real-time tracking and notifications require a stable internet connection (Mobile Data or Wi-Fi) to receive updates from our servers.";faq_a14,166,V4009625ce,da009626a4,;"If the icon is stationary\, the bus might be stopped at a traffic light\, a designated stop\, or there may be a temporary GPS signal loss. If it persists\, check for delay notifications.";faq_a11,166,V4008d22e3,af008d238e,;"If your child misses the bus\, yes they will need to go to another transportation\, and the driver or conductor will mark them as not riding.";current_medications_optional,166,V40154558f,57015455e2,;"Current Medications (Optional)";send_sos,166,V4004a0ca0,2d004a0cc9,;"SEND SOS";faq_a12,166,V4009023de,a800902482,;"No\, because the admin decide who will be your driver. If you want to switch driver\, please contact the admin at buswatch2@gmail.com.";enter_child_s_first_name,166,V4018a6269,4d018a62b2,;"Enter child’s first name";faq_q30,166,V400c535fe,4d00c53647,;"Is the bus location updated every second?";unread,166,V400260667,290026068c,;"Unread";user_name,166,V4025a99d7,2f025a9a02,;"User Name";class_label,166,V401324e3e,2f01324e69,;"Section";e_g_peanuts_shellfish_none,166,V401655a2b,5601655a7d,;"e.g.\, Peanuts\, Shellfish (None)";capacity_format,166,V402f8c01e,3f02f8c059,;"Capacity\: %1$d/%2$d";emergency_contact_1,166,V4016a5b13,43016a5b52,;"Emergency Contact 1";_50_meters_away,166,V401bf6e1d,3a01bf6e53,;"50 meters away";student_avatar,166,V402c1b29b,3902c1b2d0,;"Student avatar";bus_departure,166,V401ee7903,3601ee7935,;"Trip Started";archived,166,V40275a068,2d0275a091,;"Archived";students_for,166,V401b76c83,3601b76cb5,;"Students For\:";_13hrs_ago,166,V401d372a8,3001d372d4,;"13hrs Ago";resolve_emergency,166,V400520ec3,3500520ef4,;"RESOLVE";location_request_success_message,166,V4024d9464,118024d9578,;"Your request has been successfully submitted! Please note that it will take 30 days before you can change your Home Address again. The admin reviews requests on a weekly basis\, so it might take a long time for approval.";faq_a8,166,V400841fe1,db008420b8,;"The SOS feature is for emergency use only. When a driver triggers an SOS\, it immediately notifies administrators and parents of children currently on board with the bus's coordinates.";faq_a9,166,V4008720fc,b4008721ac,;"The ETA is calculated based on the bus's current GPS speed\, the remaining distance to your stop\, and average traffic conditions along the route.";password_requirements,166,V40103442f,87010344b2,;"Password must contain at least 8 characters\, including 1 capital letter and 1 number.";relationship,166,V401705ca3,3501705cd4,;"Relationship";email,166,V400e03c68,2700e03c8b,;"Email";ride_option,166,V401c06e58,3401c06e88,;"Ride Option\:";faq_q20,166,V400a72bd3,3f00a72c0e,;"How do I delete my account?";authorized_pickup,166,V401735d31,4001735d6d,;"Authorized Pick Up";_40_students,166,V401a568b7,3401a568e7,;"40 Students";faq_q21,166,V400aa2cf9,4f00aa2d44,;"What if my child leaves an item on the bus?";school_name_placeholder,166,V401394fe4,3501395015,;"—";select_language,166,V4010845a3,3b010845da,;"Select Language";invalid_email_format,166,V402d1b51c,4502d1b55d,;"Invalid email format";bus_number_hint,166,V402adae8b,3802adaebf,;"e.g. BUS-001";language_icon,166,V402c8b3d2,2302c8b3f1,;"";faq_q28,166,V400bf3407,5100bf3454,;"How do I update my child's grade or section?";faq_q29,166,V400c23507,4600c23549,;"Does the app use a lot of battery?";faq_q26,166,V400b931fa,4a00b93240,;"Can both parents track the same child?";maximize_map,166,V401c76faf,3501c76fe0,;"Maximize Map";faq_q27,166,V400bc32ff,5200bc334d,;"What happens during school holidays or breaks?";faq_q24,166,V400b33010,4000b3304c,;"How do I log out of the app?";enter_child_s_section_grade,166,V40191645f,4d019164a8,;"Enter child’s section";faq_q25,166,V400b630db,4d00b63124,;"How do I know if the bus is near